- Returns 0 on success, 5 on verify failure, 1/2 on early exits.

### Function 2 @ 0x67e0 — AES-256-GCM encrypt wrapper
- Signature: `(out, outlen, in, inlen, key, iv, aad, aadlen, tag, taglen)` roughly.
- `EVP_CIPHER_CTX_new`, `EVP_aes_256_gcm`.
- `EVP_EncryptInit_ex` (cipher, NULL, NULL, NULL).
- `EVP_CIPHER_CTX_ctrl(ctx, 9, ivlen, NULL)` — ctrl 9 = `EVP_CTRL_GCM_SET_IVLEN`.
- `EVP_EncryptInit_ex(NULL, NULL, key, iv)`.
- `EVP_EncryptUpdate(NULL, out, &outl, in, inlen)` — encrypts plaintext.
- `EVP_EncryptUpdate(NULL, out+outl, &outl2, aad, aadlen)` — feeds AAD.
- `EVP_EncryptFinal_ex(out+outl, &outl3)`.
- `EVP_CIPHER_CTX_ctrl(ctx, 0x10, 0x10, tag)` — ctrl 0x10 = `EVP_CTRL_GCM_GET_TAG`, 16-byte tag.
- Returns total length (outl + final).

### Function 3 @ 0x6970 — AES-256-GCM decrypt wrapper
- Signature: `(out, outlen, in, inlen, key, iv, aad, aadlen, tag, taglen)`.
- `EVP_CIPHER_CTX_new`, `EVP_aes_256_gcm`.
