- `EVP_CIPHER_CTX_ctrl(ctx, 0x11, 0x10, tag)` — ctrl 0x11 = `EVP_CTRL_GCM_SET_TAG`, 16-byte tag.
- `EVP_DecryptFinal_ex(out+outl, &outl3)` — verifies tag.
- Returns total plaintext length if tag OK, else -1.

